[l_english.pihc_allied_research]
Faction Joint Research

[l_english.pihc_allied_research_desc]
We will encourage our research institutes to collaborate with those of our allies. This will gain us a tech sharing bonus.

[l_english.pihc_apple_pie_family_research]
Apple Pie Family Research Center

[l_english.pihc_apple_pie_family_research_desc]
The Apple Family and the Rock Family have jointly established a research center to share the advanced research results of agricultural and industrial technologies.

[l_english.pihc_international_research]
International Research Cooperation

[l_english.pihc_international_research_desc]
We will encourage our research institutes to collaborate with international research institutes. This will gain us a tech sharing bonus.

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_allied_research]
阵营联合研究

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_allied_research_desc]
我们将鼓励我们的科研所与盟友的科研所合作。提高我们的科研共享奖励。

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_apple_pie_family_research]
苹果派联合研究中心

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_apple_pie_family_research_desc]
苹果家族与石头家族共同成立了研究中心，共享农业与工业技术先进的研究成果。

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_international_research]
国际研究合作

[l_simp_chinese.pihc_international_research_desc]
我们将鼓励我们的科研所与国际科研所合作。提高我们的科研共享奖励。
